İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والآلاء: هي النعم؛ والنعم كلها من آياته الدالة على<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 8/31</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">قلت: قد ضمن {تتمارى} معنى تكذب. ولهذا عداه بالتاء.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/302</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قال ابن عباس: تكذب؟ .»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/302</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s53a55\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/53-42.html\">Önceki âyet (53:42)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/53-56.html\">Sonraki âyet (53:56)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/53-56.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: An-Najm 53:56 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"İşte bu, önceki uyarıcılar gibi bir uyarıcıdır.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/53-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/53-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/53-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/53-56.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/53-56.htm